                "text": "Millions of Americans across the country will soon be receiving notices with massive increases to their health insurance. Republicans have put us in a health care affordability crisis, and working families in the United States cannot afford premiums doubling. It\u2019s time for Republicans to negotiate with Democrats and reopen the government while protecting health care for all Americans.\n\nIf you\u2019re looking for more information, visit https://t.co/oKJQaLaI76",
