                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This health care fight is the difference of life and death for some of my constituents. I heard from Rachel in Renton, who is currently fighting cancer, and would have to pay over $900 a month in health insurance because Republicans are stripping away Affordable Care Act tax credits.\n\nI am fighting for those just like Rachel to keep critical health care coverage.",
