                "text": "Bridget from Bellevue just got notice that her family\u2019s health care insurance is expected to skyrocket by 50%. Families in our country cannot afford to see premiums jump by $19,000 a year.\n\nThis shutdown fight is so important so Bridget, her husband, and their sons can be covered and afford to live their lives. I am holding the line for those in WA-09 who could see health care costs go through the roof.",
