                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Trump Administration continues to increase prices for Americans.\n\nHealth care premiums for 2026 are expected to be drastically higher, from Medicare Part B to the ACA Marketplace.\n\nOur country cannot afford to pay more for all types of health care coverage next year, and it's time to address this ongoing health care crisis.",
